plugins/*.wasm
plugins/*.manifest.json
dashboard.json

# Built plugin components and their staged sidecar manifests.
#
# Both are build output: `sd-plugins build` compiles plugins/<name>/ and copies
# the artifact plus that plugin's own `plugin.manifest.json` into plugins/ under
# the artifact's stem. Committing them meant two manifests for every plugin —
# the source one and a staged copy — with nothing keeping them in step, so an
# edited source manifest silently kept granting the old capabilities until
# someone remembered to rebuild. The source `plugins/<name>/plugin.manifest.json`
# is the single tracked definition; run `make build-plugins-release` to produce
# these.
/plugins/*.wasm
/plugins/*.manifest.json
